sequenceDiagram
    %% present_diagram, set_emphasis, the reader's selection, get_presentation_context
    %% ADR 0005 (emphasis), ADR 0011 (reader's view and selection)
    actor agent as Coding agent
    participant app as MCP server (application layer)
    participant svc as Background service
    participant page as Archer page
    actor person as Person
    agent->>app: present_diagram viewId, annotation
    app->>app: compile the source, else use the last good model
    app->>svc: attach root, then present viewId, annotation
    svc->>svc: new presentationId, viewport fit-all, clear selection if the view changed
    svc-)page: SSE presentation (envelope, stamp, annotation) and inventory
    svc-->>app: page url, presentationId
    app-->>agent: url to give the person, or the ui resource in an MCP Apps host
    page-->>person: diagram drawn, annotation as caption
    agent->>app: set_emphasis viewId, id, groups of node and edge ids
    app->>svc: setEmphasis
    alt any id unknown or any field invalid
        svc-->>app: invalid_emphasis listing every problem, nothing published
    else all groups resolve against the model
        svc-)page: SSE emphasis
        page-->>person: flow or highlight groups with a legend
    end
    person->>page: click, shift-click or marquee
    alt browser page
        page->>svc: POST api/selection with presentationId or reader:viewId, revision, ids
    else MCP Apps host
        page->>app: set_selection tool and updateModelContext
        app->>svc: setSelection
    end
    alt stamp or revision no longer current
        svc-->>page: 409 revision_conflict
    else valid ids
        svc->>svc: store ids only, labels re-derived from the model
    end
    person->>agent: what about these?
    agent->>app: get_presentation_context
    app->>svc: getContext
    svc-->>app: presentation and selection with labels
    app-->>agent: what the person is looking at and has selected
